M-4.7，Coding 能力卓越，被诸多编程工具选择为内置模型\n\n09\n\n月\n\n智谱最新旗舰 GLM-4.6，代码能力全面对齐 Claude Sonnet 4，更好支持复杂长线任务，综合能力达全球开源模型 SOTA\n\n07\n\n月\n\n发布面向推理、代码与智能体的开源SOTA模型 GLM-4.5\n\n03\n\n月\n\n发布沉思模型, 集合操作能力AutoGLM沉思\n\n2024\n\n12\n\n月\n\n发布并上线推理模型GLM-Zero Preview\n\n10\n\n月\n\n发布手机智能体AutoGLM\n\n08\n\n月\n\n对齐文本/图像/视频/声音的多模型模型VideoCall\n\n01\n\n月\n\n发布新一代基座大模型 GLM-4，国内率先对标GPT4\n\n2023\n\n03\n\n月\n\n中国第一个千亿对话基座模型ChatGLM\n\n2022\n\n09\n\n月\n\n中国第一个开源的千亿基座模型GLM-130B\n\n2021\n\n03\n\n月\n\n发布自研预训练框架 GLM, 打破BERT/GPT 瓶颈\n\n2019\n\n智谱成立， 源自清华计算机系知识工程实验室 (KEG)\n\n联系电话：400-6883-991\n\n商务合作：service@zhipuai.cn\n\n市场公关：pr@aminer.cn\n\n投资者关系：ir@aminer.cn\n\n北京市海淀区中关村东路 1 号院 9 号楼 10 层--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nZ.ai - Inspiring AGI to Benefit Humanity (https://www.zhipuai.cn/en/research/147)\nciteturn2711search7 [wordlim: 200] Published: 9 months ago; Crawled: yesterday; 2025/12/10 16:00 Mutimodal AI ... For scenarios demanding high pronunciation accuracy, such as educational assessments and audiobooks, GLM-TTS introduces the Phoneme-in mechanism to address automatic pronunciation ambiguity in polyphones (e.g., \"行\" which can be read as xíng or háng) and rare characters.\n\n# GLM-TTS: Controllable & Emotion-Expressive Zero-shot TTS with Multi-Reward Reinforcement Learning\n\n2025/12/10 16:00 Mutimodal AI\n\nGLM-TTS is a high-quality text-to-speech (TTS) synthesis system based on large language models, supporting zero-shot voice cloning and streaming inference. This system adopts a two-stage architecture: first, it uses LLM to generate speech token sequences, then uses Flow model to convert tokens into high-quality audio waveforms. By introducing a Multi-Reward Reinforcement Learning framework, GLM-TTS can generate more expressive and emotional speech, significantly improving the expressiveness of traditional TTS systems.\n\nFeatures:\n\n  * Zero-shot Voice Cloning: Clone any speaker's voice with just 3-10 seconds of prompt audio\n  * RL-enhanced Emotion Control: Achieve more natural emotional expression and prosody control through multi-reward reinforcement learning framework\n  * Streaming Inference: Support real-time streaming audio generation, suitable for interactive applications\n  * High-quality Synthesis: Generate natural and expressive speech with quality comparable to commercial systems\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nZ.ai - Inspiring AGI to Benefit Humanity (https://www.zhipuai.cn/zh/glmImage)\nciteturn2711search8 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 days ago; 其中，自回归模块部分结构采用并初始化自[GLM-4-9B-0414][1]，参数量为9B；扩散解码器模块则沿用了[CogView4][2]的单流DiT结构，参数量为7B。\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nZ.ai - Inspiring AGI to Benefit Humanity (https://www.zhipuai.cn/en/about)\nciteturn2711search9 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 days ago; [Button: 2025][Button: 2024][Button: 2023][Button: 2022][Button: 2021][Button: 2019] ... Zhipu's next-generation flagship model GLM-4.7 and China's top-performing coding model. ... AutoGLM Rumination, the AI Agent with deep research and operational capabilities was launched. ... 10F, Building 9, No.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nZ.ai - Inspiring AGI to Benefit Humanity (https://www.zhipuai.cn/zh)\nciteturn2711search10 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Image: AI Slides头脑风暴 ... Image: GLM-5.3\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGitHub - greenstevester/songgeneration: The official code repository for LeVo: High-Quality Song Generation with Multi-Preference Alignment · GitHub (https://github.com/greenstevester/songgeneration)\nciteturn2711search11 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; SongGeneration-v1.5-small  | 2m  | zh, en, es, ja, etc.\n"
